      "created_at": "2014-08-20T14:57:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When a character is incapacitated their cards leave play, and when the cards leave play the things that are put in play by those cards go away.</p><p>The scenario powers stay in play when the villain is incapped, so the drones, turrets and battalions stay in play.</p>",
